### 东信和平库位码与电子标签条码绑定接口测试
@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8090

### 1. 创建绑定-成功
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/location/label-mapping
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "locationCode": "LOC_PDA_20260407_001",
  "labelCode": "03E2D88CE1DC",
  "stationCode": "10001"
}

### 2. 创建绑定-参数错误（locationCode为空，预期400）
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/location/label-mapping
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "locationCode": "",
  "labelCode": "03E2D88CE1DC"
}

### 3. 删除绑定-成功
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/location/label-mapping?labelCode=03E2D88CE1DC

### 4. 删除绑定-不存在（预期业务错误）
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/location/label-mapping?labelCode=03E2D88CE1DD

### 5. 删除绑定-参数错误（labelCode为空，预期400）
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/location/label-mapping?labelCode=

### 6. 创建绑定-二维码格式 locationCode（双引号开头，取 Lot 字段）
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/location/label-mapping
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "locationCode": "\"OrdNo\":\"2025122365-1+01\";\"Lot\":\"A1-11-01-01-01\";\"Qty\":\"170\"",
  "labelCode": "03E2D88CE1DC",
  "stationCode": "10001"
}
